**AIService**

Defined in `proto/api/v1/ai_service.proto:11`, with the RPC declared at line 13:

```proto
service AIService {
  // Transcribe transcribes an audio file using an instance AI provider.
  rpc Transcribe(TranscribeRequest) returns (TranscribeResponse) {
    option (google.api.http) = {
      post: "/api/v1/ai:transcribe"
      body: "*"
    };
    option (google.api.method_signature) = "audio";
  }
}
```

It's the only RPC on that service, exposed over HTTP as `POST /api/v1/ai:transcribe`, taking `TranscribeRequest` (a `TranscriptionAudio` oneof source, `proto/api/v1/ai_service.proto:22-41`) and returning `TranscribeResponse` with a single `text` field (line 43-46).
